le as text; YT via l.messenger.com redirect decoded (u= param) to youtu.be/<id>.","methodology_v4":"Re-scrape v4 (2026-05-05): Full history captured via React fiber loadPrevious() loop (CDP). 3359 DOM articles total, 737 window messages (vs 589 prior). @-mention profile URLs (facebook.com/<numeric_id>/) now excluded from FB link counts. video_uploaded=0 confirmed: all messenger_media anchors have imgAlt=\"Open photo\", never \"Open video\". Totals: video_fb=33, video_yt=18, video_ig=2, type_video=53.","methodology_v5":"FB Data Download (DYI) JSON archive -- ground truth, no DOM scraping. Archive: facebook-bubakazouba-2026-05-08-otsvpzYw.zip (1.27 GB, 1 of 1 parts). Thread: ohanameansfamily_962639783771350/message_1.json. 2581 total msgs in archive (2025-05-09 to 2026-05-08), 1082 in 6-month window (excl 6 unsent/deleted). Type classifier: audio > gif > video_uploaded (mp4 direct) > image (photos[]) > share.link domain (video_fb: /reel/ /videos/, video_yt: youtu.be/youtube.com, video_ig: /reel/ /p/) > link_facebook > link_other > text. DOM was blind to: 18 direct video uploads (mp4 camera-roll) which had imgAlt=Open photo in CDP. CDP total 737 vs DYI 1082 = 345 missed messages (47% undercount).","methodology_v6":"Reclassification v6 (2026-05-05): Per Sahmoud request, FB reels, FB video shares, YT video links, and IG reel links are now classified as LINK subtypes -- not \"video\". Only m[\"videos\"] (real camera-roll MP4 uploads) remain as type=video. New link subtypes: link_fb_reel (facebook.com/reel/ or /share/r/), link_fb (all other FB shares incl /share/v/ /videos/), link_yt (youtu.be / youtube.com), link_ig (instagram.com), link_other (text URLs + unknown). type_totals.link = sum of all five subtypes and must equal the donut sum. Fixes the bug where filter Link(18) vs donut Facebook=41 were inconsistent (old link_fb was not folded into link count).","prior_cdp_total":737,"dyi_total":1082,"delta_vs_cdp":345,"methodology_v10":"Extended analyses v10 (2026-05-05): 8 